(lang dune 3.0)

(name cm_surface)

; Isolated CM surface-language front-end (issue #115, sub of #114).
; Deliberately its OWN dune-project so `dune build` in src/engine/ocaml never
; descends here, and so this front-end shares no dependency with the frozen
; `coh` engine. Stdlib only: no yojson / menhir / ppx / external libs — the JSON
; serializer is hand-written to reproduce `cue export`'s exact bytes.
